    apply: "Decide what portion of your next income you will set aside first for God, and do it before other spending. Pick one special cause you are moved to support with a freewill gift. Offer your day to God each morning in a short prayer of surrender. Memorise Proverbs 3:9.",
    activity: "Read Exodus 35:20-29 and Deuteronomy 26:1-11 and list the kinds of gifts and the attitudes. Discuss what a modern firstfruits practice could be. Ask each learner to write a morning prayer of surrender. Pray together for willing and costly love.",
