    apply: "Ask your church leaders how finances are reported and who oversees them, asking respectfully and with willingness to help. Pray for those who handle money. If you serve in church finance, review your practices for openness. Memorise 2 Corinthians 8:21.",
    activity: "Read 2 Corinthians 8:16-24 and Acts 6:1-7 and list the safeguards. Ask groups to sketch a simple financial policy for a small church. Discuss common risks. Pray for faithful stewards.",
    takeHome: "Read 2 Corinthians 8:16-9:5, Acts 6:1-7, 2 Kings 12:4-16 and Luke 16:1-15. Write three safeguards you would suggest for a church. Memorise 2 Corinthians 8:21.",
